  "description": {
    "en": "Yonex PolyTour Fire is a responsive polyester monofilament designed for medium-to-fast swing speeds seeking added power and spin. Its SIF (Silicone oil Infused Filament) technology, developed in cooperation with NANODAX, is engineered to increase string movement and snapback speed. Within the Yonex PolyTour family, Fire sits toward the softer and more responsive side of the performance map, making it a lively power-spin option rather than a firm control-oriented polyester.",

    "zh": "Yonex PolyTour Fire 是一款以快速响应、Snapback、力量和旋转为核心的聚酯单丝球线，主要面向中高速挥拍球员。它采用与 NANODAX 合作开发的 SIF（Silicone oil Infused Filament）技术，将硅油融入单丝材料中，以提升球线移动速度和 Snapback 效率。根据 Yonex 官方性能图，PolyTour Fire 位于整个 PolyTour 家族偏 Soft、偏 Responsive 的区域，因此它更接近一款活跃的 Power-Spin Poly，而不是 PolyTour Strike 那种偏硬、低力量、强调绝对控制的球线。"
  },

